{"created": "2026-08-20T14:27:11.592605+00:00", "modified": "2026-08-20T14:27:11.740484+00:00", "id": 22030918, "conceptrecid": "8187477", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22030918", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.8187477", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22030918", "metadata": {"title": "Peridynamics.jl", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22030918", "publication_date": "2026-08-20", "description": "<h2>Peridynamics v0.5.4</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/kaipartmann/Peridynamics.jl/compare/v0.5.3...v0.5.4\">Diff since v0.5.3</a></p>\n<p><strong>Merged pull requests:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Implement <code>trunc_pyramid</code> point generator function (#260) (@mdienst)</li>\n<li><code>rotate!</code> function for point clouds (#263) (@mdienst)</li>\n<li>how to parameter study (#269) (@robertweinbrenner)</li>\n<li>Add export of the strain energy density for the CKIMaterial (#270) (@kaipartmann)</li>\n<li>Fix bug in <code>_update_acc_and_vel!</code> (#272) (@mdienst)</li>\n<li>Collapsed docstrings in API pages (#273) (@mdienst)</li>\n<li>Processing of failed jobs (#274) (@kaipartmann)</li>\n<li>Bump julia-actions/cache from 2 to 3 (#276) (@dependabot[bot])</li>\n<li>Bump codecov/codecov-action from 5 to 6 (#277) (@dependabot[bot])</li>\n<li>Fixed a broken MPI test with Julia v1.10 (#278) (@kaipartmann)</li>\n<li>Bump julia-actions/setup-julia from 2 to 3 (#279) (@dependabot[bot])</li>\n<li>Bump codecov/codecov-action from 6 to 7 (#280) (@dependabot[bot])</li>\n<li>Bump actions/checkout from 6 to 7 (#281) (@dependabot[bot])</li>\n<li>Add a script to run testitems from the terminal (#284) (@kaipartmann)</li>\n<li>Add a benchmarking framework (#285) (@kaipartmann)</li>\n<li>Fixes the <code>BACMaterial</code> (#286) (@kaipartmann)</li>\n<li>Overhaul of the testing suite (#287) (@kaipartmann)</li>\n<li>Make the <code>DynamicRelaxation</code> damping global and decomposition-independent (#289) (@kaipartmann)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Closed issues:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Problems with the BACMaterial (#242)</li>\n<li>Collapsed docs in API pages (#268)</li>\n<li>Bug in function <code>_update_acc_and_vel!</code> (#271)</li>\n<li><code>DynamicRelaxation</code> results depend on the number of chunks/ranks (#288)</li>\n</ul>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Partmann, Kai", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0000-0002-5238-4355"}, {"name": "Dienst, Manuel", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0009-0004-9195-0112"}, {"name": "Weinberg, Kerstin", "affiliation": null, "orcid": "0000-0002-2213-8401"}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://github.com/kaipartmann/Peridynamics.jl/tree/v0.5.4", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "v0.5.4", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/kaipartmann/Peridynamics.jl"}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "mit-license"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 12, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "8187477"}}]}, "notes": "If you use this software, please cite it as below."}, "title": "Peridynamics.jl", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22030918", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22030918", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22030918?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22030918", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22030918", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22030918", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22030918/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/8187477", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/8187477", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.8187477", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.8187477", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22030918/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22030918/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22030918/files", "media_fi